<translation id="6072463441809498330">Yenza i-Enterprise Browser Isheshe</translation>
<translation id="6096348254544841612">Enza ngendlela oyifisayo uphinde ulawule i-Enterprise Browser. Isibuyekezo siyatholakala.</translation>
<translation id="6107893135096467929">Kuvuliwe • I-Enterprise Browser ayikwazi ukuqinisekisa ukuthi lesi sandiso sivela kuphi</translation>
<translation id="611228897408671387">I-akhawunti yakho kuEnterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="6119438414301547735">Vumela isandiso ukuze ubonise izicelo zokufinyelela kubha yamathuluzi ye-Enterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="6129621093834146363">I-<ph name="FILE_NAME" /> iyingozi, ngakho-ke i-Enterprise Browser iyivimbile.</translation>
<translation id="6132897690380286411">I-Enterprise Browser izovala maduzane futhi isule idatha</translation>
<translation id="6145820983052037069">Ungashintsha phakathi kwamaphrofayela we-Enterprise Browser lapha</translation>
<translation id="615103374448673771">Uma uvumela amakhukhi, i-Enterprise Browser ingase iwasebenzise lapho ilayisha kusengaphambili</translation>
<translation id="6165508094623778733">Funda kabanzi</translation>
<translation id="6173308241973263798">Sula idatha yeEnterprise Browser e-akhawuntini yakho</translation>
<translation id="6174920971222007286">Leli fayela kungenzeka libe nobungozi<ph name="LINE_BREAK" />I-Enterprise Browser ingakuhlolela lokhu okudawunilodwayo uma unikeza iphasiwedi. Ulwazi mayelana nefayela luthunyelwa kokuthi Ukuphequlula ngokuphephile kwe-Google, kodwa okuqukethwe kufayela kanye nephasiwedi kusala kudivayisi yakho.</translation>
<translation id="6182736845697986886">Ukufaka kuhlulekile ngenxa yephutha langaphakathi leseva yokubuyekeza.</translation>
<translation id="6183079672144801177">Yenza isiqinisekiso sokuthi ungene ngemvume ku-Enterprise Browser ku-<ph name="TARGET_DEVICE_NAME" /> yakho bese uzama ukuthumela futhi.</translation>
<translation id="6204922163963157461">Olunye uhlelo kukhompuyutha yakho lwengeze i-app engaguqula indlela iEnterprise Browser esebenza ngayo.

<ph name="EXTENSION_NAME" /></translation>
<translation id="6212496753309875659">Le khompyutha isivele inenguqulo yakamuva kakhulu ye-Enterprise Browser. Uma isofthiwe ingasebenzi, sicela ukhiphe i-Enterprise Browser uphinde uzame futhi.</translation>
<translation id="6219195342503754812">{0,plural, =0{I-Enterprise Browser izoqalisa kabusha manje}=1{I-Enterprise Browser izoqalisa kabusha kusekhondi elingu-1}one{I-Enterprise Browser izoqalisa kabusha kumasekhondi angu-#}other{I-Enterprise Browser izoqalisa kabusha kumasekhondi angu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="6239161312595354541">Buza Ukusesha Ngezithombe ngale vidiyo</translation>
<translation id="6241367896540709610">I-Enterprise Browser idinga imvume yokufinyelela kusitoreji ukuze idawunilode amafayela</translation>
<translation id="6245734527075554892">Kuhlola ama-URL anohlu lwamasayithi angaphephile agcinwe ku-Enterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="6248213926982192922">Yenza i-Enterprise Browser ibe yisiphequluli esizenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="6268381023930128611">Phuma ku-Enterprise Browser?</translation>
<translation id="6270547683008298381">Lawa mathebhu asebenzisa izinsiza ezengeziwe. Ukuze uthuthukise ukusebenza kwakho, vumela iEnterprise Browser iwenze angasebenzi.</translation>
<translation id="6281746429495226318">Yenza ngokwezifiso iphrofayela yakho ye-Enterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="6290827346642914212">Qama iphrofayela lakho le-Enterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="6294831894865512704">Isandiso sifuna ukuthi ungene kuEnterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="6295779123002464101">I-<ph name="FILE_NAME" /> kungenzeka ibe ingozi, ngakho-ke i-Enterprise Browser iyivimbile.</translation>
<translation id="6309712487085796862">I-Enterprise Browser isebenzisa ikhamela yakho.</translation>
<translation id="6327105987658262776">Asikho isibuyekezo esitholakalayo.</translation>
<translation id="6333502561965082103">Okunye ukusebenza ku-Enterprise Browser kuyaqhubeka. Sicela uzame futhi emuva kwesikhathi.</translation>
<translation id="6334986366598267305">Manje kulula ukusebenzisa i-Enterprise Browser nge-Akhawunti yakho ye-Google nakumakhompyutha abiwe.</translation>
<translation id="6347933965114150440">Isinqamuleli se-Enterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="6366160072964553914">I-Enterprise Browser ivimbele lokhu kudawunilodwa ngoba ifayela alivamile ukudawunilodwa futhi lingase libe yingozi</translation>
<translation id="6373523479360886564">Ingabe uqinisekile ukuthi ufuna ukukhipha i-Enterprise Browser?</translation>
<translation id="6375219077595103062">Engeza isinqamuleli Kusiphathi Sephasiwedi</translation>
<translation id="6388799252195623474">ngisize ngalokhu</translation>
<translation id="6390800440335263989">Ukuze uqhubeke, ngena ngemvume kuEnterprise Browser njengo-<ph name="EMAIL" />. Lokhu kuqinisekisa ukuthi unezinqubomgomo zenhlangano yakho.</translation>
<translation id="6400112897226594999">Ilogo ye-Enterprise Browser ngaphakathi kwesikrini sekhompyutha.</translation>
<translation id="6403826409255603130">I-Enterprise Browser yisiphequluli sewebhu esiqalisa amakhasi wewebhu nezinhlelo zokusebenza ngesivinini sombani. Iyashesha, izinzile, futhi isebenziseka kalula. Dlulisa amehlo kuwebhu ngokuvikeleke kakhulu ngokuvikelwa kuhlelo olungayilungele ikhompyutha nobugebengu bokweba imininingwane ebucayi eyakhelwe ku-Enterprise Browser.</translation>
<translation id="642132557830635295">IEnterprise Browser iyashesha ukuqalisa futhi izakhi ezisebenzisa iJavaScript kufanele zisebenze ngendlela eziklanywe ngayo</translation>
<translation id="6436260184216827876">Usesho Lomfanekiso alutholakali. Zama futhi kamuva.</translation>
<translation id="6442900851116057561">Qalisa kabusha i-ChromiumOS</translation>
<translation id="6443470774889161065">I-Enterprise Browser ilayisha kusengaphambili amakhasi engeziwe ongase uwavakashele, ukuze alayishe ngokushesha kakhudlwana lapho uwavakashela</translation>
<translation id="645458117210240797">Kuvaliwe • I-Enterprise Browser ayikwazi ukuqinisekisa ukuthi lesi sandiso sivela kuphi</translation>
<translation id="6455857529632101747">Siyakwamukela kumaphrofayela we-Enterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="6466344609055215035">Susa I-akhawunti kuEnterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="6475912303565314141">Iphinde ilawule ukuthi iliphi ikhasi eliboniswa lapho uqala i-Enterprise Browser.</translation>
<translation id="648319183876919572">Ukubhrawuza Ngokuphepha Okugqamile kwenza okuningi ukukuvikela kumawebhusayithi ayingozi nakokudawunilodiwe</translation>
<translation id="6510925080656968729">Khipha i-Enterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="651535675648445253">Izinqamuleli zivulwe ku-Enterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="6539122709674868420">Inhlangano yakho ivala i-Enterprise Browser uma ingasetshenziswa isikhathi esingu-<ph name="TIMEOUT_DURATION" />. Idatha yokubhrawuza isuliwe. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando, ukugcwalisa ngokuzenzakalelayo, nokudawuniloda.</translation>
<translation id="6542839706527980775">Iphrofayela ngalinye linolwazi lwalo lwe-Enterprise Browser njengamabhukhimakhi, umlando, amaphasiwedi, nokuningi</translation>
<translation id="6563921047760808519">Funda kabanzi mayelana <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />nokuthi i-Enterprise Browser igcina kanjani idatha yakho iyimfihlo<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="6564039629497156115">Izinguquko kule sethingi zizosetshenziswa uma iEnterprise Browser iqala kabusha.</translation>
<translation id="656935081669708576">Ungashintsha ukuze ubone amaphasiwedi kusuka kwenye iphrofayela ye-Enterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="6570579332384693436">Ukuze kulungiswe amaphutha okupeletwa, i-Enterprise Browser ithumela umbhalo owuthayiphayo kuzinkambu zombhalo ku-Google</translation>
<translation id="6598877126913850652">Iya kuzilungiselelo zesaziso se-Enterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="6600016381025017075">Sesha noma yini kuleli khasi</translation>
<translation id="6613594504749178791">Izinguquko zakho zizosebenza ngesikhathi esilandelayo uma uqalisa kabusha i-Enterprise Browser.</translation>
<translation id="6648212540664651655">Qhubeka lapho ogcine khona: IEnterprise Browser ibuyisele amathebhu esikhathi esedlule Ungakuvala lokhu ku-</translation>
<translation id="665732753414869868">I-Enterprise Browser idinga imvume yekhamera ukudala imephu ye-3D yendawo yakho ekuzungezile</translation>
<translation id="6669284030132180248">Uma futhi ulondoloza amabhukhimakhi ku-Google Account yakho, ungakwazi ukulandelela izintengo zomkhiqizo ku-Enterprise Browser futhi waziswe uma intengo yehla.</translation>
<translation id="6676384891291319759">Finyelela i-inthanethi?</translation>
<translation id="668175097507315160">I-ChromiumOS ayikwazanga ukuvumelanisa idatha yakho yenxa yephutha lokungena ngemvume.</translation>
<translation id="6691132793308828750">Susa idatha yale app kusukela kuEnterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="6692797197837897398">I-Enterprise Browser ikunikeza ukulawula okwengeziwe ezikhangisweni ozibonayo futhi ikhawulela lokho amasayithi angakufunda ngawe uma ekubonisa izikhangiso eziqondene nawe</translation>
<translation id="6709350901466051922">I-Enterprise Browser idinga imvume yemakrofoni kule sayithi</translation>
<translation id="6712881677154121168">Iphutha lokudawuniloda: <ph name="DOWNLOAD_ERROR" />.</translation>
<translation id="6717134281241384636">Iphrofayela yakho ayikwazi ukusetshenziswa ngoba isuka kunguqulo entsha ye-Enterprise Browser. 

Ezinye izici kungenzeka zingatholakali. Sicela ucacise umkhombandlela wephrofayela ehlukile noma usebenzise inguqulo entsha ye-Enterprise Browser.</translation>
<translation id="6729124504294600478">Ukuze uthole ukwenza ngokomuntu ngamunye nezinye izakhi, ezifaka i-Enterprise Browser Kumsebenzi wewebhu nowe-app nakumasevisi alinkiwe e-Google</translation>
<translation id="6734291798041940871">I-Enterprise Browser isivele ifakiwe kubo bonke abasebenzisi kukhompuyutha yakho.</translation>
<translation id="6742093177587589736">Ukuze uthole amabhukhimakhi nokuningi kuwo wonke amadivayisi akho, ngena ngemvume kuEnterprise Browser. Le bhokhimakhi izolondolozwa kuGoogle Account yakho ngemva kokungena ngemvume.</translation>
<translation id="6751374565094704799">Isheshisa amasayithi ngenjini yeEnterprise Browser V8 kodwa yenza iEnterprise Browser imelane kancane nokuhlaselwa. Le sethingi livuliwe.</translation>
<translation id="6754665438209053659">{count,plural, =1{Enye idatha yakho yeEnterprise Browser ayikalondolozwa kuGoogle Account yakho njengamanje. Zama ukulinda imizuzu embalwa ngaphambi kokuphuma ngemvume. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha (into e-1) izosulwa.}one{Enye idatha yakho yeEnterprise Browser ayikalondolozwa kuGoogle Account yakho njengamanje. Zama ukulinda imizuzu embalwa ngaphambi kokuphuma ngemvume. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha (izinto ezingu-{count}) izosulwa.}other{Enye idatha yakho yeEnterprise Browser ayikalondolozwa kuGoogle Account yakho njengamanje. Zama ukulinda imizuzu embalwa ngaphambi kokuphuma ngemvume. Uma uphuma ngemvume manje, le datha (izinto ezingu-{count}) izosulwa.}}</translation>
<translation id="67706546131546258">I-Enterprise Browser incoma ukuthi uskene leli fayela ngenxa yokuthi kungenzeka ukuthi liyingozi.</translation>
<translation id="6779406956731413166">I-ChromiumOS yenziwa yenzeke yi-<ph name="BEGIN_LINK_CROS_OSS" />isofthiwe yomthombo ovulekile<ph name="END_LINK_CROS_OSS" /> engeziwe.</translation>
