<translation id="6990124437352146030">I-Enterprise Browser idinga imvume ukuze ifinyelele kumakrofoni yakho yaleli sayithi</translation>
<translation id="7003299027384820442">Bhala umushwana wokungena ozowusebenzisa futhi ulondoloze idatha yeEnterprise Browser ku-akhawunti yakho, <ph name="ACCOUNT_EMAIL" /></translation>
<translation id="7011190694940573312">Ukufakwa kwehlulekile ngenxa yokuthi lolu hlobo lwesistimu yokusebenza alusekelwe.</translation>
<translation id="7024536598735240744">Iphutha lokuvula: <ph name="UNPACK_ERROR" />.</translation>
<translation id="7025789849649390912">Ukufaka Kumisiwe.</translation>
<translation id="7045244423563602563">Yenza i-Enterprise Browser Ibe Ngeyakho</translation>
<translation id="7047386856539490735">Ingabe ibe wusizo le miphumela?</translation>
<translation id="705851970750939768">Buyekeza i-Enterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="7067091210845072982">Uma isithombe singanayo incazelo ephelele, i-Enterprise Browser izozama ukukunikezela eyodwa. Ukuze udale izincazelo, izithombe zithunyelwa ku-Google.</translation>
<translation id="7141270731789036260">Yenza i-Enterprise Browser ibe ngokwezifiso ukuze ihlolwe</translation>
<translation id="7147227333672430807">Ungasebenzisa iEnterprise Browser noma nini lapho uchofoza amalinki emiyalezweni, amadokhumenti, namanye ama-app</translation>
<translation id="7163519456498498587">Susa <ph name="EXTENSION_NAME" /> kuEnterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="7173822816570314652">Inhlangano yakho isula idatha ye-Enterprise Browser uma ingasetshenziswa isikhathi esingu-<ph name="TIMEOUT_DURATION" />. Lokhu kungase kuhlanganise umlando, ukugcwalisa ngokuzenzakalelayo, nokudawuniloda.</translation>
<translation id="718435575166326686">I-Enterprise Browser idinga imvume yekhamera kule sayithi</translation>
<translation id="7196312274710523067">Ayikwazanga ukuqalisa i-Enterprise Browser. Zama futhi.</translation>
<translation id="7197677400338048821">I-Enterprise Browser ayikwazi ukuhlola iphasiwedi yakho. Zama futhi emva kwamahora angu-24.</translation>
<translation id="7213008767289637091">Gcina iEnterprise Browser Edokhini yakho ukuze ufike kuyo ngokushesha noma nini</translation>
<translation id="7213407614656404070">Sebenzisa i-Enterprise Browser noma nini lapho uchofoza amalinki emiyalezweni, kumadokhumenti, nakwamanye ama-app</translation>
<translation id="7223968959479464213">Isiphathi somsebenzi - I-Enterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="7246575524853130370">Izintshisekelo zakho njengoba zilinganiselwe yi-Enterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="7274695763216404502">Kuphiniwe! Sebenzisa Usesho Lomfanekiso futhi kubha yamathuluzi</translation>
<translation id="7288567540154601580">Amathebhu nezandiso</translation>
<translation id="7295544978856094497">{NUM_EXTENSIONS,plural, =1{I-Enterprise Browser incoma ukuthi usisuse}one{I-Enterprise Browser incoma ukuthi uzisuse}other{I-Enterprise Browser incoma ukuthi uzisuse}}</translation>
<translation id="7296334833518879294">Ukuze wabelane ngomsindo wohlelo, vula Amasethingi Ohlelo bese uvumela okuthi 'Ukurekhodwa Komsindo Wohlelo Kuphela' kuEnterprise Browser. Ngemva kwalokho kuzodingeka uqale kabusha iEnterprise Browser.</translation>
<translation id="7309928523159922338">Isilinganiso sesikhangiso sivumela amasayithi owavakashelayo ukuba acele ulwazi ku-Enterprise Browser olusiza isayithi ukukala ukusebenza kwezikhangiso zawo. Isilinganiso sesikhangiso sikhawulela ukulandelela indawo yonke ngokudlulisa ulwazi oluncane ngangokunokwenzeka phakathi kwamasayithi.</translation>
<translation id="731795002583552498">Ibuyekeza i-Enterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="7318036098707714271">Ifayela lakho lokuncamelayo limoshakele noma alivumelekile.

I-Enterprise Browser ayikwazi ukubuyisela izilungiselelo zakho.</translation>
<translation id="7339898014177206373">Iwindi elisha</translation>
<translation id="734373864078049451">Iwebhu yakho, amabhukhimakhi, nezinye izinto ze-Enterprise Browser zihlala lapha.</translation>
<translation id="7347827960336370838">Ngumuntu onomushwana wakho wokungena kuphela ongafunda idatha yakho ebetheliwe. Umshwana wokungena awuthunyelwa noma ulondolozwe yiGoogle. Uma ukhohlwa umushwana wakho wokungena noma ufuna ukushintsha le sethingi <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />susa idatha yeEnterprise Browser ku-akhawunti yakho<ph name="END_LINK" />.</translation>
<translation id="7349591376906416160">Umlawuli wakho wesistimu ulungiselele i-Enterprise Browser ukuthi ivule i-<ph name="ALTERNATIVE_BROWSER_NAME" /> ukuze ifinyelele ku-<ph name="TARGET_URL_HOSTNAME" />.</translation>
<translation id="7352651011704765696">Okuthile akuhambanga kahle</translation>
<translation id="7376384068949534168">Awukavakashi kamuva nje. IEnterprise Browser isuse i-<ph name="PERMISSION_1" />, i-<ph name="PERMISSION_2" /></translation>
<translation id="7384121030444253939">Lesi sandiso asisasekelwa. IEnterprise Browser incoma ukuthi usisuse esikhundleni salokho.</translation>
<translation id="7413153308467572558">Qhubeka lapho ogcine khona: IEnterprise Browser ingabuyisela amathebhu akho njalo lapho uqala kabusha Ukuze ukuvale lokhu, iya ku-</translation>
<translation id="7427879960656355200">Ngenisa Amaphasiwedi KuEnterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="7449453770951226939"><ph name="PAGE_TITLE" /> - Enterprise Browser Dev</translation>
<translation id="7450541714075000668">Umbhalo okopishiwe</translation>
<translation id="7451052299415159299">I-Enterprise Browser idinga imvume yakho ukuze ifinyelele kukhamera yakho yaleli sayithi</translation>
<translation id="7458892263350425044">Ukuze usebenzise imakrofoni yakho, nikeza iEnterprise Browser ukufinyelela <ph name="BEGIN_LINK" />amasethingi ohlelo<ph name="END_LINK" /></translation>
<translation id="7461356015007898716">Ukuze uthole izibuyekezo zesikhathi esizayo ze-Enterprise Browser, uzodinga i-Windows 10 noma yakamuva. Le khompyutha isebenzisa i-Windows 7.</translation>
<translation id="7467949745582939695">Qalisa kabusha i-Enterprise Browser?</translation>
<translation id="7483335560992089831">Ayikwazi ukufaka inguqulo ye-Enterprise Browser efana nale esebenzayo okwamanje. Sicela uvale i-Enterprise Browser uphinde uzame futhi.</translation>
<translation id="7517403744065880907">Uzolondoloza futhi usebenzise amaphasiwedi nokunye okwengeziwe kuGoogle Account yakho noma nini uma ungene ngemvume kuEnterprise Browser. <ph name="LEARN_MORE" /></translation>
<translation id="751935028865900641">Amasayithi cishe azosebenza njengokulindelwe. Uzophuma ngemvume kumasayithi amaningi uma uvala wonke amawindi e-Enterprise Browser, ngaphandle kwe-Google Account yakho uma ungene ngemvume ku-Enterprise Browser.</translation>
<translation id="753534427205733210">{0,plural, =1{I-Enterprise Browser izoqalisa kabusha kuminithi elingu-1}one{I-Enterprise Browser izoqalisa kabusha emaminithini angu-#}other{I-Enterprise Browser izoqalisa kabusha emaminithini angu-#}}</translation>
<translation id="7565444033145385702">Ukuvikela idatha lakho vumela iEnterprise Browser isuse izimvume emasayithini ongakawavakasheli muva nje.</translation>
<translation id="7583399374488819119">Isifaki Se-<ph name="COMPANY_NAME" /></translation>
<translation id="761356813943268536">I-Enterprise Browser isebenzisa ikhamela yakho nemakrofoni.</translation>
<translation id="7617377681829253106">I-Enterprise Browser ibe ngcono nakakhulu</translation>
<translation id="7622753900276619808">Manje unezakhi eziningi ezitholakala kuEnterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="7649070708921625228">Usizo</translation>
<translation id="7658239707568436148">Khansela</translation>
<translation id="7686590090926151193">I-Enterprise Browser akusona isiphequluli sakho esizenzakalelayo</translation>
<translation id="7689606757190482937">Vumelanisa uphinde wenze kube ngeyakho i-Enterprise Browser kumadivayisi akho wonkana</translation>
<translation id="7699779824407626136">Isibuyekezo se-Enterprise Browser</translation>
<translation id="7716950018788545737">Imisebenzi iqediwe.</translation>
<translation id="77283119132245232">Inikeza amasevisi okulandelela isistimu ku-<ph name="BROWSER_NAME" />. Uma le sevisi ikhutshaziwe, ukusebenza kokulandelela okusungulwe yibhrawuza ngeke kuhlanganise imisebenzi yobubanzi besistimu njengokushintshwa kokuqukethwe kanye nemisebenzi esikulungele yochungechunge.</translation>
<translation id="7745317241717453663">Lokhu kuzosusa idatha yakho yokuphequlula kusukela kule divayisi. Ukuze uthole idatha yakho emuva kwesikhathi, ngena ngemvume ku-Enterprise Browser njengo-<ph name="USER_EMAIL" />.</translation>
<translation id="7747138024166251722">Isifaki asikwazanga ukudala umkhombandlela wesikhashana. Sicela uhlolele isikhala esikhululekile sediski nemvume ukuze ufake isofthiwe.</translation>
<translation id="7786760609782648049">Yenza i-Enterprise Browser isheshe</translation>
