<translation id="8232193495299001329">I-Enterprise Browser ayikwazi ukuqinisekisa ukuthi lesi sandiso sivelaphi, futhi kungenzeka ukuthi asiphephile. Sisuse ku-Enterprise Browser ukuze singasakwazi ukubona nokushintsha idatha yakho kumasayithi owavakashelayo, okufaka phakathi ulwazi lomuntu siqu.</translation>
<translation id="8248265253516264921">Uma isithombe singanayo incazelo ephelele, i-Enterprise Browser izozama ukukunikezela eyodwa. Ukuze udale izincazelo, izithombe zithunyelwa ku-Google. Ungavala lokhu kuzilungiselelo noma kunini.</translation>
